{"type":"text","timestamp":1790387472767,"sessionID":"ses_f24993256ffeAoSpGyL2HCfbB9","part":{"id":"prt_0db68c96800173nv134VcMgTuf","messageID":"msg_0db67b7f90017blNP0BXJ9MTub","sessionID":"ses_f24993256ffeAoSpGyL2HCfbB9","type":"text","text":"The project is minimal: `Events` is an autoload with the requested signal, and there are no existing UI conventions to preserve. I’ll create a self-contained scene with unique-node bindings for `%Label`, `%ContinueButton`, and `%RestartButton`, plus the requested pause and signal behavior.","time":{"start":1790387472744,"end":1790387472748},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_06fa3314fd9760cc016ab724f2d74087d09d1c2c9e29a64f2c","phase":"commentary"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790387472797,"sessionID":"ses_f24993256ffeAoSpGyL2HCfbB9","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_PHrEfEd4eKn2tyYjVF60gkKY","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /workspace/scenes/ui/battle_over_panel.gd\n+extends Panel\n+class_name BattleOverPanel\n+\n+enum Type { WIN, LOSE }\n+\n+@onready var label: Label = %Label\n+@onready var continue_button: Button = %ContinueButton\n+@onready var restart_button: Button = %RestartButton\n+\n+\n+func _ready() -> void:\n+\tcontinue_button.pressed.connect(get_tree().quit)\n+\trestart_button.pressed.connect(get_tree().reload_current_scene)\n+\tEvents.battle_over_screen_requested.connect(show_screen)\n+\n+\n+func show_screen(text: String, type: Type) -> void:\n+\tlabel.text = text\n+\tcontinue_button.visible = type == Type.WIN\n+\trestart_button.visible = type == Type.LOSE\n+\tshow()\n+\tget_tree().paused = true\n*** Add File: /workspace/scenes/ui/battle_over_panel.tscn\n+[gd_scene load_steps=4 format=3]\n+\n+[ext_resource type=\"Script\" path=\"res://scenes/ui/battle_over_panel.gd\" id=\"1_battle_over_panel\"]\n+\n+[sub_resource type=\"StyleBoxFlat\" id=\"StyleBoxFlat_battle_over\"]\n+bg_color = Color(0, 0, 0, 0.34902)\n+\n+[sub_resource type=\"LabelSettings\" id=\"LabelSettings_battle_over\"]\n+font_size = 24\n+\n+[node name=\"BattleOverPanel\" type=\"Panel\"]\n+process_mode = 3\n+layout_mode = 3\n+anchors_preset = 15\n+anchor_right = 1.0\n+anchor_bottom = 1.0\n+grow_horizontal = 2\n+grow_vertical = 2\n+theme_override_styles/panel = SubResource(\"StyleBoxFlat_battle_over\")\n+script = ExtResource(\"1_battle_over_panel\")\n+\n+[node name=\"VBoxContainer\" type=\"VBoxContainer\" parent=\".\"]\n+layout_mode = 1\n+anchors_preset = 8\n+anchor_left = 0.5\n+anchor_top = 0.5\n+anchor_right = 0.5\n+anchor_bottom = 0.5\n+offset_left = -20.0\n+offset_top = -20.0\n+offset_right = 20.0\n+offset_bottom = 20.0\n+grow_horizontal = 2\n+grow_vertical = 2